WEBVTT

01:41.500 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.860 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 6]

01:49.789 --> 01:50.479
In the future,

01:50.479 --> 01:51.840
I will take you to visit places one by one,

01:52.070 --> 01:53.000
and play at each location.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.430
Take this sword

01:54.920 --> 01:55.680
and come with me

01:56.039 --> 01:57.430
to protect this interesting mortal world.

01:58.590 --> 01:59.150
How about that?

02:01.040 --> 02:01.510
Let's go.

02:01.530 --> 02:02.070
Let's go for a drink.

02:03.270 --> 02:04.120
You go back and wait for me first.

02:14.290 --> 02:15.490
You're here to rush us again?

02:15.910 --> 02:17.470
The red dress you ordered

02:17.470 --> 02:18.750
will be ready tonight.

02:19.440 --> 02:20.720
It's for your sweetheart, isn't it?

02:22.960 --> 02:23.750
Then I'll come to pick it up later.

02:24.310 --> 02:24.870
Alright.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.240
Take care, young master.

02:45.470 --> 02:47.560
You returned to the capital but didn't come see me.

02:48.840 --> 02:50.430
Have you forgotten your father?

02:50.990 --> 02:52.040
From now on, my affairs

02:52.520 --> 02:53.590
will be my own decision.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.670
You need not concern yourself anymore.

03:00.710 --> 03:01.680
It seems

03:02.650 --> 03:04.720
you've forgotten the excruciating pain

03:04.750 --> 03:06.000
of the Heavenly Bottle.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.190
What?

03:31.970 --> 03:33.650
Young Master has cultivated a Golden Core,

03:33.960 --> 03:34.960
not a Demonic Core.

03:38.780 --> 03:40.020
You wanted me to form a Demonic Core

03:40.160 --> 03:41.050
so you could use this Heavenly Bottle

03:41.079 --> 03:42.079
to control me for life.

03:42.840 --> 03:43.400
Father,

03:43.870 --> 03:45.040
this thing is useless now.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.060
How can this be?

03:51.079 --> 03:52.030
I've known for a long time

03:52.030 --> 03:53.120
that you wanted me to form a Demonic Core,

03:53.690 --> 03:55.000
so I voluntarily entered the Eternal Sect

03:55.240 --> 03:56.280
to seek a solution.

03:56.940 --> 03:57.680
Now, I found

03:57.710 --> 03:58.870
this method at Mount Wester.

03:59.310 --> 03:59.910
Remember.

04:00.400 --> 04:01.750
I am the one who will control the Spirit Spring,

04:02.240 --> 04:03.400
not the other way around.

04:04.110 --> 04:05.030
From now on, I won't

04:05.030 --> 04:05.840
bend at your will anymore.

04:12.680 --> 04:13.590
Yishui,

04:14.650 --> 04:16.430
my previous strictness towards you

04:16.860 --> 04:18.240
was all for your own good.

04:19.790 --> 04:21.640
Was it Mu Qingge who instigated this?

04:22.600 --> 04:23.920
That Mu Qingge

04:23.920 --> 04:25.920
has a deep relationship with Su Yu.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.510
You've been deceived by her.

04:35.190 --> 04:35.720
That should be

04:35.740 --> 04:37.060
the key to the entrance of the netherworld, right?

05:00.270 --> 05:01.040
This Demon Detector

05:01.510 --> 05:02.360
can't be wrong, can it?

05:02.940 --> 05:04.360
I've gone to great lengths to find this

05:04.380 --> 05:06.300
Yin Eye Stone that can detect demonic energy,

05:06.600 --> 05:08.430
and then hired skilled craftsmen to spend years

05:08.630 --> 05:09.800
to create this Demon Detector.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.130
All of this was done to sense

05:12.160 --> 05:13.510
the location of the Spirit Spring and the Demon's child.

05:14.470 --> 05:15.590
It can't be wrong.

05:25.680 --> 05:26.510
Just a little more.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.400
Once my spiritual power advances further,

05:29.270 --> 05:30.070
I'll be able to see

05:30.070 --> 05:31.070
the location of the Spirit Spring.

05:31.800 --> 05:32.430
And then?

05:34.720 --> 05:36.430
Kill me, take my place,

05:36.450 --> 05:37.310
then

05:37.950 --> 05:39.000
rule the universe?

05:43.120 --> 05:43.750
In the past,

05:44.830 --> 05:46.000
that was my plan.

05:47.830 --> 05:48.510
But now,

05:49.600 --> 05:51.190
I feel that ruling the universe alone

05:51.800 --> 05:52.830
is quite boring.

05:59.159 --> 06:00.600
Being manipulative

06:00.620 --> 06:02.120
and cold-hearted

06:02.530 --> 06:04.300
is how you should be.

06:04.630 --> 06:05.310
Yishui,

06:05.690 --> 06:07.130
don't become a laughingstock.

06:07.530 --> 06:08.650
But some people make you believe

06:08.680 --> 06:09.510
there's another possibility.

06:09.750 --> 06:11.720
Mu Qingge is not sincere to you.

06:11.940 --> 06:12.740
I'm telling you,

06:13.560 --> 06:14.510
she's coaxing you

06:14.880 --> 06:16.410
all because of Su Yu.

06:16.710 --> 06:17.430
The two of them

06:17.430 --> 06:18.480
will surely seize the universe.

06:18.500 --> 06:19.750
If you don't believe it, just wait.

06:20.000 --> 06:20.720
I will certainly

06:20.720 --> 06:21.730
provide you with evidence.

06:23.720 --> 06:25.250
I'd like to see your evidence.

06:29.720 --> 06:30.950
Young Master, Prince,

06:31.070 --> 06:32.430
you're related by blood, after all.

06:32.950 --> 06:34.240
Why be so tense?

06:35.610 --> 06:36.240
Young Master,

06:36.600 --> 06:37.190
have a cup of tea.

06:37.510 --> 06:39.830
A father and son shouldn't be like this.

06:51.680 --> 06:53.030
Just now, someone indeed

06:53.060 --> 06:54.100
was summoning the Spirit Spring.

06:54.440 --> 06:55.760
The only one capable of doing this

06:56.750 --> 06:57.900
is the Demon's child.

06:58.970 --> 07:00.410
Turn the remaining Yin Eye Stones

07:00.440 --> 07:01.590
into compasses.

07:01.720 --> 07:02.960
Distribute them to all Heavenly Sects in the universe.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.560
We must find the Demon's child.

07:09.270 --> 07:09.830
Yu.

07:10.190 --> 07:11.390
What's so urgent?

07:11.750 --> 07:13.230
I just received a message.

07:13.510 --> 07:14.830
The Demon Detector on Mount Eternal was triggered.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.190
Someone is summoning the Spirit Spring.

07:16.680 --> 07:18.120
The Spirit Spring has been missing for years.

07:18.610 --> 07:19.560
How could it suddenly appear?

07:21.000 --> 07:21.750
Could it be the Demonic Sect

07:21.750 --> 07:22.720
found some method?

07:23.310 --> 07:24.560
I don't think it's necessarily the Demonic Sect.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.270
Do you have any clues?

07:27.040 --> 07:28.160
Prince Ping's desire

07:28.160 --> 07:29.720
for the throne is well-known.

07:29.950 --> 07:30.800
Last month, His Majesty's

07:30.800 --> 07:31.920
condition suddenly worsened,

07:31.980 --> 07:32.980
yet he still didn't act.

07:33.390 --> 07:34.310
This is very suspicious.

07:35.480 --> 07:36.270
Are you saying

07:36.980 --> 07:38.540
Prince Ping is summoning the Spirit Spring?

07:39.190 --> 07:39.900
It's very possible.

07:42.430 --> 07:43.000
Qingge,

07:43.890 --> 07:45.490
I know the Heavenly Sect doesn't meddle in worldly affairs,

07:45.920 --> 07:46.800
but this matter...

07:46.800 --> 07:47.560
I will investigate.

07:48.070 --> 07:48.870
You're willing to help me?

07:49.390 --> 07:50.480
It's not to help you.

07:51.070 --> 07:52.270
It's just that it concerns the Spirit Spring.

07:52.600 --> 07:53.240
I can't be negligent.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.680
The Spirit Spring was created with the Mortal-Demon Lord's spiritual

07:56.680 --> 07:57.720
power and consciousness,

07:58.430 --> 07:59.600
hence its name,

08:00.720 --> 08:01.480
yet it is

08:01.480 --> 08:02.600
the most evil thing in the world.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.270
Very well.

08:05.830 --> 08:06.510
With you taking action,

08:06.680 --> 08:08.510
those evil demons won't be able to cause trouble.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.000
Qingge,

08:12.280 --> 08:13.750
[Fragrant Pavilion]

08:12.610 --> 08:13.340
look at what this is.

08:15.130 --> 08:16.270
Pastries from Fragrant Pavilion.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.390
Qingge,

08:18.950 --> 08:20.110
do you remember when we first met?

08:20.240 --> 08:21.800
We became acquainted because of these two pastries.

08:22.160 --> 08:22.870
Today, I specially

08:22.870 --> 08:23.920
bought them again for you to taste.

08:30.830 --> 08:31.360
Delicious.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.320
You treated me to dessert,

08:35.559 --> 08:36.210
so I'll treat you to

08:36.230 --> 08:37.870
my homemade Mistaken Divine.

08:39.909 --> 08:40.600
Come,

08:40.840 --> 08:41.909
have a few more drinks with me.

08:43.240 --> 08:43.909
Do you see that?

08:44.720 --> 08:46.480
Your Master and that kid Su Yu

08:46.500 --> 08:47.480
get along very well.

08:49.440 --> 08:50.390
Now you should believe

08:50.390 --> 08:51.630
what I said, right?

08:54.580 --> 08:55.340
We've waited for so long,

08:56.060 --> 08:56.690
but it's nothing more than

08:56.720 --> 08:58.000
grasping at straws.

09:00.080 --> 09:00.790
You should focus on taking care

09:00.790 --> 09:01.790
of your health.

09:12.790 --> 09:14.510
What's going on?

09:15.030 --> 09:16.000
Didn't you say it'd be useless

09:16.000 --> 09:17.240
no matter how Mu Qingge taught him?

09:18.960 --> 09:19.470
Your Highness,

09:20.080 --> 09:21.720
it was indeed my negligence.

09:22.170 --> 09:23.330
I never expected Mu Qingge

09:23.530 --> 09:25.130
would come up with such a method.

09:25.720 --> 09:26.720
She put in so much effort

09:26.720 --> 09:28.080
to eliminate Young Master's murderous intent.

09:28.550 --> 09:30.620
Combined with the merit of a hundred good deeds,

09:30.660 --> 09:33.210
she forcibly transformed the Demonic Core into a Golden Core.

09:35.590 --> 09:36.900
Mu Qingge...

09:37.760 --> 09:39.360
That damned Mu Qingge!

09:46.670 --> 09:47.270
It doesn't matter.

09:48.150 --> 09:49.200
He just has

09:49.200 --> 09:50.670
a woman in his heart now.

09:51.480 --> 09:52.650
Su Yishui hasn't changed.

09:53.250 --> 09:54.000
He won't change.

09:54.150 --> 09:54.670
No,

09:55.390 --> 09:56.480
Young Master has already changed.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.600
If his heart can accommodate one person,

09:59.030 --> 10:00.200
it can accommodate a second.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.600
Weakness and kindness can take advantage

10:03.080 --> 10:04.720
of this pried-open crack

10:05.030 --> 10:06.550
and enter.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.240
However, fortunately,

10:08.240 --> 10:10.240
luck is on your side.

10:10.270 --> 10:10.960
What do you mean?

10:11.240 --> 10:11.870
Your Highness,

10:12.200 --> 10:13.870
I just added a drop of Falling Water

10:14.200 --> 10:15.390
to Young Master's tea.

10:16.000 --> 10:16.440
This substance

10:16.440 --> 10:17.550
will magnify the suspicion

10:17.550 --> 10:19.120
and resentment in his heart a hundredfold.

10:20.020 --> 10:20.790
As long as Mu Qingge's image

10:20.790 --> 10:22.200
in his heart collapses,

10:23.160 --> 10:26.160
the young master will surely be disheartened

10:27.150 --> 10:28.750
and turn to the dark side.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.400
Mu Qingge.

10:48.030 --> 10:49.460
When I master the demonic magic in the future,

10:50.000 --> 10:51.270
I'll definitely capture you

10:51.550 --> 10:52.840
and make you taste

10:52.870 --> 10:54.510
the consequences of offending me, Wei Jiu.

10:56.720 --> 10:58.310
If you want to deal with Mu Qingge,

10:58.600 --> 10:59.670
why wait?

11:00.460 --> 11:01.780
You can do it now.

11:02.890 --> 11:03.730
Who are you?

11:04.910 --> 11:06.390
Someone who wants to help you.

11:09.170 --> 11:09.900
It's so late.

11:10.290 --> 11:11.800
Why hasn't Shui returned yet?

11:15.550 --> 11:17.000
Immortal Master, save us!

11:17.550 --> 11:18.510
Immortal Master, please help!

11:18.640 --> 11:20.550
My son encountered a monster in the southern suburbs.

11:20.790 --> 11:21.960
His fate is unknown.

11:22.360 --> 11:23.270
I beg you, Immortal Master.

11:23.440 --> 11:24.790
Please save him.

11:25.670 --> 11:26.390
Leave it to me.

11:41.790 --> 11:42.700
Be careful, Immortal Master.

11:42.870 --> 11:43.320
Monster!

11:43.600 --> 11:44.320
There's a monster!

11:46.440 --> 11:47.480
It's coming! It's coming!

11:48.030 --> 11:48.550
Immortal Master,

11:48.910 --> 11:49.600
behind you!

11:50.070 --> 11:51.830
I should be wary of you lot, shouldn't I?

12:01.380 --> 12:02.620
The Scarlet Sect's Smokescreen technique.

12:03.430 --> 12:04.640
You demonic cultivators

12:04.760 --> 12:05.960
put on a show for me, huh?

12:15.790 --> 12:16.550
Come out.

12:17.300 --> 12:18.940
This kind of childish trick

12:19.090 --> 12:19.870
is so boring.

12:27.270 --> 12:28.320
It's you?

12:29.090 --> 12:30.160
What was your name again?

12:32.320 --> 12:32.840
Right,

12:33.300 --> 12:33.920
Wei Jiu.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.450
Mu Qingge,

12:35.910 --> 12:36.720
I told you

12:37.440 --> 12:38.610
that if you didn't accept me as your disciple,

12:38.840 --> 12:39.960
you would regret it.

12:40.300 --> 12:41.420
I don't regret it at all.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.750
I didn't see your face clearly yesterday,

12:44.000 --> 12:45.480
but today, the more I look, the more...

12:46.630 --> 12:47.670
unimpressive you seem.

12:50.180 --> 12:51.820
I wonder if your mouth will still be so glib

12:52.600 --> 12:53.320
when you're

12:53.630 --> 12:55.150
crying and begging for mercy.

12:55.570 --> 12:56.000
Attack!

13:37.200 --> 13:38.250
Can't we just let it go?

13:38.890 --> 13:40.890
This kind of fight is so boring.

13:45.030 --> 13:45.680
Get into formation!

14:00.360 --> 14:01.870
Even wasting so many demonic cultivators' lives

14:01.870 --> 14:02.700
won't trap me.

14:03.320 --> 14:03.840
What's the point?

14:04.510 --> 14:06.120
Keeping you here for just a moment

14:06.910 --> 14:07.790
is enough.

14:36.830 --> 14:37.710
Stop struggling.

14:37.990 --> 14:39.520
No matter how much spiritual power you have,

14:39.720 --> 14:41.290
it will be completely used up

14:41.320 --> 14:42.440
by the Tainted Demonic Serpent.

14:43.390 --> 14:44.440
A monster from the netherworld.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.830
How dare you use such evil methods!

14:47.600 --> 14:48.320
You and I

14:48.440 --> 14:49.510
are clearly the same kind of person.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.150
Who cares what methods I use?

14:51.720 --> 14:52.750
Even a Transcendence immortal master

14:53.080 --> 14:55.080
won't be able to defeat this netherworld demon.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.080
One qi.

15:01.240 --> 15:02.000
Break the galaxy!

15:09.360 --> 15:10.270
Even if she escaped,

15:10.480 --> 15:11.600
she must have been poisoned by the Tainted Demonic Serpent.

15:11.840 --> 15:12.340
Go.

15:12.570 --> 15:13.420
Get her back here.

15:31.550 --> 15:32.240
Shui.

15:37.810 --> 15:38.680
I'll take you back.

15:43.870 --> 15:45.030
Hand over Mu Qingge to us.

15:45.420 --> 15:46.140
Otherwise...

15:54.630 --> 15:56.470
None of you will leave here alive today.

16:17.840 --> 16:18.440
It's you.

16:19.120 --> 16:19.720
Young Lord,

16:19.910 --> 16:20.550
our men

16:20.790 --> 16:21.550
were all killed by him.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.270
Su Yishui,

16:24.600 --> 16:26.120
I've never liked you.

16:26.870 --> 16:27.570
Today...

16:27.600 --> 16:28.750
You hurt her.

16:30.580 --> 16:31.320
Yes.

16:32.160 --> 16:32.840
So what?

16:56.140 --> 16:57.080
Are you trying to kill yourself?

16:57.440 --> 16:58.880
You hurt her, so I'll take your life.

17:18.790 --> 17:19.920
Consecrating the sword with vital blood

17:20.270 --> 17:21.109
reduces your lifespan.

17:21.349 --> 17:21.720
You...

17:22.000 --> 17:22.880
Is it worth it?

17:23.130 --> 17:24.700
Is Mu Qingge that important to you?

17:42.920 --> 17:43.780
Madman.

18:42.830 --> 18:43.960
Shui,

18:44.330 --> 18:45.240
it's you?

18:52.430 --> 18:53.700
I've forced out the poison.

18:54.680 --> 18:55.480
In a little while,

18:56.150 --> 18:57.260
your spiritual power will recover.

18:58.200 --> 18:58.920
Where's Wei Jiu?

19:00.070 --> 19:00.640
He escaped.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.000
You...

19:07.440 --> 19:08.160
You're hurt?

19:09.880 --> 19:11.790
You've just recovered. Don't talk so much.

19:12.380 --> 19:13.180
Rest well.

19:17.070 --> 19:18.000
Are you trying to kill yourself?

19:18.320 --> 19:19.770
You hurt her, so I'll take your life.

19:23.420 --> 19:24.580
Reckless boy,

19:26.050 --> 19:27.580
don't risk your life so carelessly in the future.

19:34.120 --> 19:35.600
A drink would be great

19:35.660 --> 19:36.610
right now.

19:39.160 --> 19:39.880
When you drink in the future,

19:40.510 --> 19:41.350
you can call me too.

19:43.910 --> 19:45.540
I thought you couldn't drink.

19:46.380 --> 19:47.100
I can drink.

20:27.440 --> 20:28.440
You want me to protect

20:28.460 --> 20:29.590
this interesting mortal world with you.

20:31.400 --> 20:32.310
But in my eyes,

20:33.400 --> 20:34.510
it's only interesting

20:34.510 --> 20:35.510
if you're here.

20:37.590 --> 20:38.270
What I want to protect

20:39.990 --> 20:41.270
is a mortal world with you in it.

20:43.620 --> 20:45.120
[Bless the Virtuous]

20:45.000 --> 20:45.510
Master.

20:45.630 --> 20:46.190
Master.

20:47.880 --> 20:48.400
Master,

20:48.590 --> 20:49.480
you're finally back.

20:50.170 --> 20:50.960
Consonance Palace's design

20:50.960 --> 20:51.920
is so comprehensive.

20:52.200 --> 20:53.930
Alchemy room, music hall, flower room, study...

20:54.130 --> 20:55.030
It has everything.

20:55.170 --> 20:57.390
[Consonance Palace]

20:55.410 --> 20:56.790
There's even a large kitchen.

20:59.150 --> 21:00.550
It's so simple yet spacious.

21:00.980 --> 21:02.250
Yu seems to understand me well.

21:03.180 --> 21:03.700
Master,

21:04.400 --> 21:05.920
this wasn't built by Lord Su Yu.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.350
Then who was it?

21:08.200 --> 21:08.750
I built it.

21:10.680 --> 21:11.270
You?

21:12.310 --> 21:13.680
Didn't Yu send craftsmen?

21:14.550 --> 21:15.630
Su Yu's people couldn't continue,

21:16.030 --> 21:17.240
so I hired craftsmen to take over.

21:18.270 --> 21:19.000
What do you mean "take over"?

21:19.200 --> 21:19.960
It was forceful seizure!

21:20.210 --> 21:21.320
Our lord put his heart and soul into it,

21:21.350 --> 21:21.960
surveying the land

21:22.070 --> 21:22.790
and preparing the materials.

21:23.310 --> 21:23.960
You rascal

21:24.270 --> 21:25.590
actually sent people to tear up the blueprints

21:25.720 --> 21:26.550
and drove away the craftsmen,

21:26.880 --> 21:28.270
and yet you have the nerve to call it "taking over"?

21:28.880 --> 21:30.200
Su Yu doesn't practice in the Heavenly Sect.

21:30.590 --> 21:31.830
Of course he doesn't understand Heavenly principles.

21:32.550 --> 21:33.680
The palace on Mount Wester

21:33.700 --> 21:35.140
should naturally be built by people from Mount Wester.

21:35.510 --> 21:37.030
Indeed, I didn't think it through.

21:37.880 --> 21:38.480
Qingge,

21:38.950 --> 21:39.880
I just wanted to do

21:39.880 --> 21:41.310
what I could for you.

21:41.600 --> 21:42.840
But I forgot that Heavenly cultivation

21:42.990 --> 21:43.680
follows different paths.

21:44.160 --> 21:45.190
Perhaps some immortals

21:45.400 --> 21:46.380
are cold-hearted

21:46.590 --> 21:47.510
and struggle to understand human emotions.

21:48.340 --> 21:49.510
Seeing our affection

21:50.060 --> 21:50.920
might disturb their cultivation.

21:51.200 --> 21:51.960
Who knows?

21:52.830 --> 21:53.790
Yu treats me well.

21:53.920 --> 21:54.750
I've known that for a long time.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.440
It doesn't just depend on the Consonance Palace.

21:56.960 --> 21:57.610
Besides,

21:57.790 --> 21:59.000
wasn't that mountain gate

21:59.020 --> 21:59.780
built by you a few years ago?

22:00.230 --> 22:01.550
I'm happy whenever I see it.

22:02.160 --> 22:02.750
Later,

22:02.990 --> 22:04.200
I should thank you properly.

22:04.830 --> 22:05.200
Alright.

22:06.030 --> 22:06.830
I have some matters to attend to,

22:06.920 --> 22:07.680
so I'll take my leave now.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.550
Qingge.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.350
Anything else?

22:15.680 --> 22:17.180
Your birthday is approaching.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.960
That's why I came to build this Consonance Palace.

22:20.200 --> 22:20.790
I almost forgot

22:21.600 --> 22:22.790
I have another gift for you.

22:24.590 --> 22:26.030
You don't need to be so polite all the time.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.310
It was Wu that day

22:27.310 --> 22:28.400
who made me choose with her for a long time.

22:28.510 --> 22:29.270
We finally picked this one.

22:29.790 --> 22:30.830
We were worried you might not like it.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.750
It's not an expensive item.

22:33.200 --> 22:34.550
Don't let our efforts go to waste.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.090
This is also Wu's heartfelt gift.

22:38.550 --> 22:39.000
Okay.

22:39.590 --> 22:40.480
Then I'll accept it.

22:52.240 --> 22:52.750
Junior Brother,

22:52.960 --> 22:53.750
you've come just in time.

22:53.910 --> 22:55.100
I'm distributing sword manuals to everyone.

22:55.310 --> 22:55.960
Can you help me

22:55.960 --> 22:56.880
deliver this Heart Sutra that Master wants

22:56.880 --> 22:57.480
to her?

23:20.830 --> 23:21.790
This white jade

23:22.590 --> 23:24.240
is enough for you to buy another house.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.270
Alright, alright, alright.

23:42.350 --> 23:43.070
Immortal Su,

23:43.640 --> 23:44.750
why are you blocking my way?

23:45.590 --> 23:46.310
Su Yu,

23:47.580 --> 23:48.950
what's your intention for giving her

23:49.240 --> 23:50.310
this kind of thing?

24:01.510 --> 24:02.590
Su Yishui,

24:03.750 --> 24:05.200
you're the one that should be asked that.

24:05.500 --> 24:06.890
This is my gift to Mu Qingge.

24:06.920 --> 24:08.240
What right do you have to destroy it?

24:08.550 --> 24:09.200
Don't think I don't know

24:09.200 --> 24:10.030
what your intentions are.

24:11.070 --> 24:11.830
I'm warning you.

24:12.140 --> 24:13.030
Stop bothering her.

24:13.710 --> 24:15.270
Even if the capital turns upside down,

24:15.810 --> 24:16.830
she won't help you.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.440
The one who should leave her side

24:21.160 --> 24:21.960
is you, isn't it?

24:22.920 --> 24:24.000
An imperial descendant

24:24.680 --> 24:26.640
who first joined the Eternal Sect and then Mount Wester.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.400
It's you

24:28.990 --> 24:30.160
who wants to get something

24:30.180 --> 24:30.980
from her.

24:32.160 --> 24:34.230
When Prince Ping was guarding the border,

24:35.030 --> 24:36.750
he loved to use dark and vicious methods.

24:37.590 --> 24:38.310
And you?

24:39.310 --> 24:41.440
You'd better not follow in his footsteps.

24:42.360 --> 24:43.430
These matters are none of your concern.

24:44.680 --> 24:45.830
You only need to know

24:46.820 --> 24:48.300
you have no chance to save the universe

24:50.590 --> 24:51.160
and

24:51.400 --> 24:52.510
you have no chance with her either.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.550
Su Yishui.

24:56.930 --> 24:59.000
I've known Qingge for over ten years.

25:00.430 --> 25:02.470
I know her thoughts better than anyone else.

25:03.350 --> 25:04.750
Let me warn you on her behalf.

25:05.970 --> 25:07.170
Whatever you and Prince Ping

25:07.200 --> 25:08.200
are planning,

25:09.070 --> 25:10.830
if it involves evil and wickedness,

25:12.100 --> 25:12.860
she and I

25:14.420 --> 25:15.590
will not spare you.

25:21.430 --> 25:22.790
Who do you think you are

25:23.480 --> 25:24.590
to speak on her behalf?

25:25.660 --> 25:27.070
How dare you speak disrespectfully to the lord!

25:27.380 --> 25:28.670
You bastard, do you have a death wish?

25:37.200 --> 25:38.230
Shui, what's going on?

25:38.640 --> 25:39.920
Why are you fighting at the foot of the mountain?

25:40.000 --> 25:40.790
He chased after us.

25:41.270 --> 25:42.440
He spoke insolently to the lord

25:42.710 --> 25:43.540
and even attacked us.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.270
Yu.

25:47.920 --> 25:48.480
It's nothing.

25:49.110 --> 25:49.870
It seems Su Yishui

25:49.890 --> 25:51.560
doesn't like what others gifted you.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.840
It's a pity about this hairpin.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.750
Although it's not valuable,

26:01.200 --> 26:02.550
it was chosen

26:02.980 --> 26:03.720
with great care.

26:29.030 --> 26:29.680
He is...

26:30.030 --> 26:31.070
He was injured before.

26:31.360 --> 26:32.960
His unstable spirit is causing this aggression.

26:34.270 --> 26:35.360
Yu, you should go down the mountain first.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.110
I'll handle

26:37.590 --> 26:38.270
Mount Wester's matters.

26:39.790 --> 26:40.400
Alright.

26:47.200 --> 26:47.790
It's working?

26:48.390 --> 26:49.950
The slightest emotions

26:50.400 --> 26:51.920
will be amplified by the Falling Water.

26:52.440 --> 26:53.840
Next, we'll find an opportunity

26:54.160 --> 26:55.360
to increase the stakes.

26:55.590 --> 26:57.310
Then we can ensure the plan is flawless.

26:57.480 --> 26:58.070
Good.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.900
The Golden Core has already formed.

27:03.570 --> 27:05.120
Why is there still demonic energy?

27:06.510 --> 27:07.160
What exactly is going on

27:07.160 --> 27:08.240
inside Shui's body?

27:12.920 --> 27:13.680
Spirit Spring...

27:20.920 --> 27:21.640
Why is there

27:21.640 --> 27:23.000
a drop of the Spirit Spring in Shui's body?

27:23.920 --> 27:25.200
What's going on?

27:34.500 --> 27:37.620
[Su Yishui's consciousness]

27:40.680 --> 27:42.400
Mother!

27:43.830 --> 27:45.670
Mother!

27:53.030 --> 27:53.790
What are you looking at?

27:58.200 --> 27:58.970
Let's go.

28:18.640 --> 28:19.440
Yishui.

28:20.030 --> 28:21.510
When you can control the Spirit Spring,

28:22.170 --> 28:24.080
seize this universe for me.

28:24.290 --> 28:25.710
[Name List]

28:26.350 --> 28:27.310
No one on this list

28:28.510 --> 28:29.430
can remain.

28:44.390 --> 28:45.950
if there are trees in front of a house,

28:46.680 --> 28:48.000
it's not just a house

28:48.720 --> 28:49.510
but

28:50.510 --> 28:51.070
home.

29:07.410 --> 29:08.220
So you...

29:12.810 --> 29:14.230
I will never let you become demonized.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.550
Wait for me to return.

29:21.350 --> 29:22.030
Where are you going?

29:23.820 --> 29:25.030
I'm going to find the person who raised me

29:25.670 --> 29:27.230
and taught me the immortal arts.

29:28.740 --> 29:30.290
Some problems are too tricky.

29:31.240 --> 29:32.790
Perhaps only he has a solution.

29:38.020 --> 29:40.630
[Uncle Ye Xin's house in Puxin Village]

29:49.920 --> 29:50.440
Wu,

29:50.810 --> 29:51.410
I'm in

29:51.430 --> 29:52.820
the wooden cabin we grew up in.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.240
There's an urgent matter

29:54.260 --> 29:55.300
I need to ask Uncle Ye Xin about.

29:55.790 --> 29:57.110
Do you know how to find him?

30:06.400 --> 30:08.030
Uncle Ye Xin knows all the immortal arts in the universe.

30:08.790 --> 30:10.030
Perhaps in his collected texts

30:10.400 --> 30:11.480
there's a method to remove

30:11.480 --> 30:12.150
the Spirit Spring.

30:27.450 --> 30:28.310
This painting...

30:44.790 --> 30:45.920
Dragon scales bound into a book.

30:47.110 --> 30:47.960
This is a Heavenly Book.

30:49.480 --> 30:51.200
Uncle Ye Xin has hidden a Heavenly Book.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.830
The Heavenly Book can glimpse the future of all things.

30:54.640 --> 30:55.510
So it should also be able to see

30:55.510 --> 30:56.400
Su Yishui's future.

31:04.160 --> 31:04.750
Master.

31:05.350 --> 31:06.210
Master, you're back.

31:06.350 --> 31:07.200
Junior Su has decorated the hall

31:07.240 --> 31:08.160
so beautifully.

31:08.880 --> 31:10.110
The Four Heavenly Sects just delivered

31:10.110 --> 31:10.960
the Demon Detector.

31:11.160 --> 31:11.960
They say everyone in the universe

31:11.960 --> 31:13.270
should search for the Demon's child together.

31:19.450 --> 31:20.240
Remember.

31:21.110 --> 31:22.400
No matter how many people die,

31:22.950 --> 31:25.130
I will rule the universe

31:25.160 --> 31:26.310
and make all submit to me.

31:26.600 --> 31:27.990
I have tempered you for years.

31:29.480 --> 31:31.210
It's time for you to repay me.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.400
I am the one who will rule the universe,

31:34.170 --> 31:34.880
not you.

31:37.360 --> 31:39.920
Kill!

31:46.440 --> 31:47.200
Su Yishui.

31:48.680 --> 31:50.590
You have become one with me.

31:52.070 --> 31:53.120
Together, let's taste

31:54.000 --> 31:55.850
the flavor of being the master of all.

32:06.020 --> 32:07.350
The Heavenly Book says

32:08.790 --> 32:09.720
Su Yishui

32:10.790 --> 32:12.590
will eventually be devoured by the Spirit Spring,

32:13.170 --> 32:14.270
become a demon, and destroy the world.

32:15.510 --> 32:16.480
Shui will be ruined,

32:17.440 --> 32:18.640
and so will the world.

32:20.610 --> 32:22.130
Is Su Yishui's demonization

32:23.480 --> 32:24.750
unstoppable now?

32:26.690 --> 32:28.340
If Su Yishui can't be changed,

32:29.070 --> 32:30.380
what would you do?

32:32.150 --> 32:33.640
I'll have no choice

32:33.880 --> 32:34.720
but to kill him myself.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.720
I'm afraid you won't be able

32:37.030 --> 32:37.750
to follow through.

32:38.880 --> 32:39.640
What should I do?

32:41.270 --> 32:42.480
Is killing him really

32:43.440 --> 32:44.640
the only way to stop all this?

32:45.720 --> 32:47.680
-You still can’t call me master?
-Master.

32:51.030 --> 32:51.680
Alright.

32:58.750 --> 32:59.720
I can't do it.

33:04.550 --> 33:06.510
Who dares to be so bold

33:06.790 --> 33:07.980
as to peek at the Heavenly Book?

33:09.110 --> 33:10.030
Immortal,

33:10.590 --> 33:12.250
can the future shown in the Heavenly Book

33:12.680 --> 33:13.820
be changed or not?

33:14.640 --> 33:15.920
What is seen in the Heavenly Book

33:16.000 --> 33:17.370
is the Heavenly Way's plan.

33:17.680 --> 33:18.590
To change it

33:18.720 --> 33:19.730
is absolutely impossible.

33:20.590 --> 33:21.790
What if I insist on changing it?

33:22.190 --> 33:23.450
Altering the Heavenly Way

33:23.480 --> 33:24.750
is going against heaven's will.

33:25.240 --> 33:27.270
The karmic force of the Heavenly Way will surely backfire,

33:27.300 --> 33:28.410
leading to irredeemable consequences.

33:29.300 --> 33:30.410
How dare you have such

33:30.440 --> 33:31.680
treasonous thoughts!

33:32.200 --> 33:34.350
I will seal you in the immortal prison forever for this.

33:50.000 --> 33:51.240
None of this has happened yet.

33:51.830 --> 33:52.550
There's still time.

33:53.640 --> 33:54.960
Since going against heaven's will was mentioned,

33:55.310 --> 33:56.830
it means there's still a chance.

33:58.110 --> 33:59.920
Shui's present and future

34:00.720 --> 34:02.200
are both burdened by Prince Ping.

34:03.590 --> 34:04.420
I must find a way

34:04.550 --> 34:05.960
to remove his identity as the Demon's child

34:06.720 --> 34:07.960
and destroy

34:08.400 --> 34:09.190
Prince Ping's ambition.

34:10.150 --> 34:11.920
I will never let the universe and Shui

34:12.580 --> 34:14.060
fall into the hopeless abyss.

34:19.190 --> 34:19.730
Qingge,

34:19.960 --> 34:20.790
I happened to be nearby.

34:20.820 --> 34:21.989
I came as soon as I received your message.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.880
What's wrong?

34:24.230 --> 34:25.550
Why do you look so upset?

34:26.889 --> 34:27.600
I saw...

34:28.440 --> 34:29.280
I saw Su...

34:31.580 --> 34:32.320
Qingge!

34:33.540 --> 34:34.790
Indeed, the karmic force of the Heavenly Way

34:35.550 --> 34:36.840
forbids me from revealing the contents of the Heavenly Book

34:36.840 --> 34:37.670
to others.

34:38.620 --> 34:39.050
Qingge,

34:39.070 --> 34:40.360
what serious injury have you suffered?

34:41.280 --> 34:42.030
I don't know how to

34:42.030 --> 34:43.320
find Uncle Ye Xin for help.

34:43.880 --> 34:44.920
How about we go to the Four Sects

34:45.150 --> 34:46.110
to seek their help for healing.

34:47.360 --> 34:47.920
Wu.

34:48.480 --> 34:49.230
Tell Yu.

34:50.150 --> 34:50.880
I want to help him.

34:54.760 --> 34:55.960
Didn't you say

34:56.440 --> 34:58.000
you wouldn't get involved in the royal power struggle,

34:58.590 --> 35:00.030
and you wouldn't help Yu anymore?

35:01.550 --> 35:02.840
Why the sudden change?

35:04.000 --> 35:05.000
There's no time to explain.

35:05.370 --> 35:06.400
You just need to tell him

35:06.880 --> 35:08.190
that I want to help his father win

35:08.440 --> 35:09.280
and gain the universe.

35:10.150 --> 35:11.190
Does he want it or not?

35:15.590 --> 35:16.710
What you can give him,

35:17.050 --> 35:18.530
I could never give.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.800
Why wouldn't he want it?

35:22.100 --> 35:24.130
[Mount Wester]

35:45.400 --> 35:46.440
J-Junior Su,

35:46.720 --> 35:47.440
you're awake.

35:48.920 --> 35:49.630
Have some water.

35:50.830 --> 35:52.300
Why do you look so flustered seeing me?

35:53.030 --> 35:54.390
Don't you remember?

35:54.920 --> 35:55.440
What?

35:56.010 --> 35:56.680
Yesterday,

35:56.710 --> 35:57.880
you saw Lord Su Yu and,

35:58.240 --> 35:58.930
for some reason,

35:58.960 --> 35:59.890
you suddenly tried to kill him.

35:59.980 --> 36:00.770
It was terrifying.

36:06.440 --> 36:08.110
Why do I suddenly get so angry?

36:08.510 --> 36:10.150
Why are my emotions so easily swayed by others?

36:12.760 --> 36:14.150
Wouldn't this scare her?

36:18.480 --> 36:19.840
I'll decorate Consonance Palace well

36:20.430 --> 36:21.470
and then apologize to her.

36:22.040 --> 36:24.460
[Unbridled Excellence]

36:36.320 --> 36:36.880
Master.

36:38.550 --> 36:39.070
Master.

36:39.670 --> 36:40.480
Master, you're back.

36:40.640 --> 36:41.520
Junior Su has decorated the hall

36:41.550 --> 36:42.440
beautifully.

36:43.960 --> 36:44.510
Master.

36:45.280 --> 36:46.540
The Four Heavenly Sects just delivered

36:46.570 --> 36:47.330
the Demon Detector.

36:47.590 --> 36:48.710
They say everyone in the universe

36:48.730 --> 36:49.510
should search for the Demon's child together.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.510
Lyu Yuan and the others

36:50.510 --> 36:51.480
are examining it in the backyard.

36:57.770 --> 36:58.370
Master.

36:59.590 --> 37:00.630
The Four Heavenly Sects just delivered

37:00.710 --> 37:01.630
the Demon Detector.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.710
It's exactly the same as what was described in the Heavenly Book.

37:07.030 --> 37:07.630
It's real.

37:08.400 --> 37:09.250
Everything is happening

37:09.280 --> 37:10.110
along this path.

37:10.680 --> 37:12.130
Quickly, go to the backyard and shut down the detector.

37:12.510 --> 37:13.070
Hurry!

37:13.780 --> 37:14.260
Yes.

37:14.360 --> 37:14.840
Alright.

37:17.490 --> 37:19.300
[Consonance Palace]

37:37.150 --> 37:37.630
I...

37:38.410 --> 37:39.450
I know you don't

37:39.480 --> 37:40.190
want me to kill again.

37:40.590 --> 37:41.710
I was wrong that day.

37:42.480 --> 37:43.960
I have decorated Consonance Palace nicely

37:44.350 --> 37:45.060
to apologize to you.

37:49.070 --> 37:50.060
Flowers bloomed on that tree.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.150
I picked these myself.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.510
Let's place it in the hall together.

37:54.040 --> 37:55.120
Consider it my apology.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.720
It seems Yishui hasn't been possessed by demons.

38:33.410 --> 38:34.500
Mu Qingge used some tricks

38:34.530 --> 38:35.760
and forcibly suppressed it.

38:35.840 --> 38:36.590
It doesn't matter though.

38:37.150 --> 38:38.190
The crack in one's heart

38:38.550 --> 38:39.630
becomes more fragile

38:40.150 --> 38:41.440
the more suppressed it is.

38:46.630 --> 38:47.150
Master,

38:48.150 --> 38:49.760
people from the Four Heavenly Sects just came and said

38:49.800 --> 38:50.480
they sensed some movement

38:50.480 --> 38:51.320
from the Demon Detector.

38:51.840 --> 38:52.920
They want to enter Mount Wester to investigate.

38:53.510 --> 38:54.530
Mount Wester doesn't receive guests.

38:54.840 --> 38:55.930
Tell them to leave immediately.

38:56.510 --> 38:57.070
Yes.

39:15.710 --> 39:16.470
Master.

39:19.470 --> 39:20.030
This is...

39:21.480 --> 39:22.360
This is the Demon-Sealing Formation.

39:23.470 --> 39:24.880
The ice spike that pierced you

39:25.670 --> 39:26.560
was formed from an Ice Lotus

39:26.580 --> 39:28.300
I chanced upon years ago.

39:29.030 --> 39:30.510
It can suppress the Spirit Spring within you.

39:31.190 --> 39:31.710
I...

39:34.080 --> 39:35.600
I won't let you continue to be the Demon's child.

39:37.550 --> 39:38.550
You've known all along.

39:39.960 --> 39:40.800
Since when?

39:41.480 --> 39:42.800
When I took you as my disciple,

39:43.570 --> 39:44.300
I already knew.

39:45.230 --> 39:46.630
So you deliberately approached me,

39:47.240 --> 39:48.010
saying you could help me

39:48.040 --> 39:48.920
find another way.

39:49.400 --> 39:50.670
Was it all planned from the beginning?

39:51.630 --> 39:53.190
My intention to eliminate evil and protect the righteous way is genuine,

39:53.760 --> 39:55.030
but my desire to take you as my disciple

39:55.230 --> 39:56.070
and teach you well

39:56.630 --> 39:57.320
is also genuine.

39:58.550 --> 39:59.280
What about you?

40:00.620 --> 40:02.260
You carry such a dangerous secret,

40:03.070 --> 40:04.320
yet you never thought about

40:04.760 --> 40:05.800
confessing it to me?

40:10.320 --> 40:11.230
I had no choice.

40:12.500 --> 40:13.950
I will remove the Spirit Spring for you.

40:14.780 --> 40:15.480
Master, please don't!

40:20.910 --> 40:22.020
Do you know how I

40:24.230 --> 40:25.440
survived Prince Ping's

40:25.440 --> 40:27.000
refining back then?

40:31.190 --> 40:32.110
If it wasn't for

40:32.110 --> 40:33.450
opening my heart to hatred

40:34.710 --> 40:35.580
and allowing that drop of Spirit Spring

40:35.610 --> 40:36.940
to take root in my heart,

40:38.320 --> 40:39.590
I would have died long ago.

40:41.400 --> 40:42.880
I want the universe.

40:43.590 --> 40:45.440
Every time I crawled back from hell,

40:46.880 --> 40:48.320
it was this belief

40:48.320 --> 40:49.190
that kept me going.

40:50.490 --> 40:51.910
I've lived with it day and night,

40:52.920 --> 40:54.630
and this thorn in my heart has long since

40:55.150 --> 40:55.710
become

40:55.710 --> 40:57.280
my courage to defy the universe.

40:58.970 --> 40:59.930
Without the Spirit Spring...

41:02.510 --> 41:03.760
I'll have nothing left.

41:07.500 --> 41:08.870
These 10 years of suffering

41:09.570 --> 41:11.360
and endurance will be meaningless.

41:13.150 --> 41:15.000
I'll become a complete joke.

41:18.480 --> 41:19.230
Master,

41:19.960 --> 41:20.800
I've never said these words

41:20.800 --> 41:22.000
to anyone before.

41:22.860 --> 41:24.690
You are the only person I trust.

41:25.880 --> 41:26.510
Master,

41:26.970 --> 41:27.900
I beg you.

41:28.360 --> 41:29.590
Please don't do this to me.

41:34.800 --> 41:35.440
No.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.000
You can't

41:39.360 --> 41:40.140
keep the Spirit Spring.

41:41.070 --> 41:42.000
After 10 years,

41:42.400 --> 41:43.760
I am almost unaffected by it now.

41:44.010 --> 41:45.110
Give me more time

41:45.360 --> 41:46.320
and I can surely suppress it.

41:46.470 --> 41:47.590
As long as I practice diligently,

41:47.680 --> 41:48.990
-one day...
-You can’t suppress it.

41:54.150 --> 41:54.880
Why?

41:56.000 --> 41:57.510
Why won't you believe me?

41:58.480 --> 41:59.030
Because...

42:00.780 --> 42:01.510
I saw...

42:02.400 --> 42:03.070
I saw Su...

42:05.840 --> 42:06.350
Qingge!

42:08.280 --> 42:09.960
I can't say the contents of the Heavenly Book.

42:11.550 --> 42:12.280
There are some things

42:12.790 --> 42:13.950
I can't tell you now,

42:14.630 --> 42:16.000
but you must believe what I say.

42:16.770 --> 42:17.640
Everything I do

42:17.660 --> 42:18.620
is to help you.

42:19.480 --> 42:20.230
Wait here.

42:20.810 --> 42:21.770
I'll go find a way

42:21.800 --> 42:22.510
to remove the Spirit Spring.

42:23.230 --> 42:24.400
Consonance Palace, heed my command.

42:25.280 --> 42:26.320
Keep an eye on Su Yishui.

42:27.400 --> 42:28.640
Don't let him move an inch.

42:34.000 --> 42:34.590
Master!

42:35.590 --> 42:37.280
When people called you a demoness,

42:38.000 --> 42:38.540
you told me

42:38.570 --> 42:40.050
not to care about the distinction between good and evil,

42:40.320 --> 42:41.590
and just focus on cultivating my own path.

42:42.510 --> 42:43.880
Why have you changed now?

42:44.630 --> 42:46.070
What is good and what is evil?

42:47.000 --> 42:48.110
Unswayed by worldly affairs

42:48.550 --> 42:50.190
and indulgence in desires is not necessarily evil.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.480
But becoming a demon for selfish reasons

42:53.070 --> 42:54.230
is undoubtedly evil.

42:57.190 --> 42:58.230
My disciples of Mount Wester

42:58.960 --> 42:59.960
must never become a demon.

43:01.520 --> 43:02.330
Master!

43:15.630 --> 43:16.800
You can't be without the Spirit Spring.

43:17.400 --> 43:18.960
Since she doesn't believe you can do it,

43:19.360 --> 43:20.750
then prove it to her.

43:21.590 --> 43:22.190
Run.

43:22.630 --> 43:23.920
Run first, talk later.
